Oh, question of the day, yeah.

00:15:08.589 --> 00:15:12.351
Oh shit, I forgot about
the question of the day.

00:15:12.351 --> 00:15:14.713
What are you doing this weekend?

00:15:15.276 --> 00:15:16.600
You keep asking questions.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.243
I'll keep answering them.

